@startuml
title <size:20><b>VoxFlow - Session Analysis Sequence</b></size>\n<size:12>Sliding-Window HuBERT-D Inference and Event Aggregation</size>

hide footbox

skinparam backgroundColor #F8FAFC
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam dpi 170

skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #475569
    LifeLineBorderColor #94A3B8
    LifeLineBackgroundColor #F8FAFC

    ParticipantBorderColor #334155
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    ParticipantFontColor #0F172A
    ParticipantFontStyle bold

    ActorBorderColor #334155
    ActorBackgroundColor #DBEAFE
    ActorFontColor #0F172A
    ActorFontStyle bold
}

skinparam participant {
    FontSize 11
}

skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

participant "Flask REST API" as API #E0F2FE
participant "ContinuousSessionEngine" as Engine #EDE9FE
participant "HuBERTInferenceEngine" as HuBERT #C4B5FD
participant "EventAggregator" as Aggregator #DDD6FE
participant "SessionSummary" as Summary #DDD6FE
database "SQLite\nvoxflow.db" as DB #ECFDF5
participant "Streamlit Dashboard" as UI #DCFCE7

== 1. Audio Validation & Sliding-Window Slicing ==

API -> Engine : process_continuous_session(audio_bytes, session_id)
Engine -> Engine : Validate audio (16 kHz mono, RMS check, >=3.0s)
Engine -> Engine : Slicing into 3.0s windows with 1.0s hop step

== 2. Sliding-Window HuBERT-D Multi-Label Inference ==

loop For Each 3.0-Second Audio Window
    Engine -> HuBERT : predict_window(waveform_chunk)
    HuBERT -> HuBERT : Forward pass through HuBERT-D backbone
    HuBERT -> HuBERT : Multi-label classification head (Sigmoids)
    HuBERT -> HuBERT : Apply locked thresholds (Rep: 0.77, Pro: 0.79, Blk: 0.57)
    HuBERT --> Engine : {Rep, Pro, Blk probs, active_labels, is_fluent, confidence}
end

== 3. Event Aggregation & Summary Calculation ==

Engine -> Aggregator : aggregate_window_events(windows, thresholds)
Aggregator -> Aggregator : Cluster consecutive active windows into events
Aggregator --> Engine : [Aggregated disfluency events]

Engine -> Summary : calculate_session_summary(windows, events, duration)
Summary -> Summary : Compute Fluency Ratio & event counts
Summary --> Engine : {summary_metrics}

== 4. Persistence & Dashboard Visualization ==

Engine -> DB : save_session_analysis(session_id, windows, events, summary)
DB --> Engine : Analysis persisted atomically
Engine --> API : 200 OK {session_id, fluency_ratio, events}

UI -> DB : get_latest_session() / get_session_details(id)
DB --> UI : Stored session summary, windows, events
UI -> UI : Render Summary Metrics, Probability Timeline,\nWindow Audit Table & Event Visualizer

@enduml